        <rows total='true'>([Grouped External Sales 2.0 (local copy) (copy)].[none:Business Type Group 2 (copy)_1386545745140359168:nk] / [Grouped External Sales 2.0 (local copy) (copy)].[none:Businesstype:nk])</rows>
