            <zone fixed-size='467' forceUpdate='true' h='59375' id='149' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='8125'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>General dashboard information</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>• </run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>First line support (questions, requests):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Wouter Krooshof / Daan Vloedgraven</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>• </run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Second line support (technical questions): </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Wouter Krooshof / Daan Vloedgraven</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>• </run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Author of the dashboard:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Daan Vloedgraven</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>• </run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Datasource used:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>•</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'> Expected refreshness:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Daily at 8.30 hr (CET) (Normally before 9:30 CET)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>• </run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Link to the documentation and definitions: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://krampgroup.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/KnowledgeTools/Shared%20Documents/Data%20and%20Insights/documenten/Daily%20Group%20Sales%20definitions.pdf?csf=1&amp;amp;amp;web=1&amp;amp;amp;e=jgbEoH&amp;quot;'>https://krampgroup.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/KnowledgeTools/Shared%20Documents/Data%20and%20Insights/documenten/Daily%20Group%20Sales%20definitions.pdf?csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=jgbEoH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>•</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'> Technical documentation:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://kramphub.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ABIC/pages/6884458534/Daily+Group+Sales?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNDc2ODNmNTBlNDBiNDFiNDk5NTBlYjVmNTZhYjYzZGUiLCJwIjoiYyJ9&amp;quot;'>https://kramphub.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ABIC/pages/6884458534/Daily+Group+Sales?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNDc2ODNmNTBlNDBiNDFiNDk5NTBlYjVmNTZhYjYzZGUiLCJwIjoiYyJ9</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Changelog</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- Jul &apos;25: New version of DGS rolled out incorporating the new segmentation.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>-Feb &apos;25: issue with &quot;leap year&quot; last year is fixed. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- August &apos;24: changes in some &quot;customer sales business unit&quot; definitions (Spain, Baltics, Croatia &amp; Slovenia, Genfitt).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- June &apos;24: invoicing days bug fix: new version is based on Countries, old version was based on CSBU&apos;s, that gave problems with e.g. Agerpol.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- April &apos;24: In this dashboard, please note that for the Republic of Ireland, the local currency has been converted from EURO to GBP, ensuring that the UK and Ireland are reported in GBP. Be aware that this adjustment is specific to this dashboard only.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- Jan &apos;24: fixed bug invoicing dates. Added absolute delta’s to tab 1, added full year (incl. future) option to the period parameter, added CSBU filter to tab 1 &gt; renamed “Country detail” on several tabs to CSBU (in order to be consistent) </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run><![CDATA[- Dec. '23: - added new landing page and "Daily Full Month tab", - changed map to customer country level, removed white columns, removed years <2020 (because of issues in data in those years), cluster subtotals added]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- Dec. &apos;23: renamed cluster Heterogenous to &quot;South West&quot;.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- Oct. &apos;23: renamed cluster CEE. Fixed bug L12M in tab &apos;Detail table&apos;. Fixed bug country detail in Sales BU (local) tab. Added invoicing dates in Colofon tab. Added Full Month option (useful in &quot;Detail table&quot; tab, changed sorting in this tab).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- June &apos;23: first version</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>FAQ&apos;s</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>- Why are the budgets empty? answer: if you filter on product category, budgets become empty.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Dashboard suites</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>This dashboard is part of a dashboard suite. A dashboard suite is a group of dashboards which are relevant for a specific user group in their day-to-day job. This dashboard is part of the following suites (in alphabetical order):</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>• Category and assortment management suite: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Category+and+assortment+management+suite&amp;quot;'>https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Category+and+assortment+management+suite</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>• Customer service suite: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Customer+service+suite&amp;quot;'>https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Customer+service+suite</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>• Pricing management suite: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Pricing+management+suite&amp;quot;'>https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Pricing+management+suite</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>• Sales management suite: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Sales+management+suite&amp;quot;'>https://dub01.online.tableau.com/#/site/kramp/workbooks?tag=Sales+management+suite</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
